<section class="faq container reveal">
  <h2>FAQ</h2>

  <details class="reveal d1">
    <summary>How to check in?</summary>
    <div class="ans">Self check-in with lockbox. We’ll message you the code after booking. Early/late arrival is okay.</div>
  </details>

  <details class="reveal d2">
    <summary>Luggage storage?</summary>
    <div class="ans">Yes. You can drop luggage before check-in or leave it after check-out the same day.</div>
  </details>

  <details class="reveal d3">
    <summary>Parking & transport</summary>
    <div class="ans">Street parking in the lane (subject to availability). Grab finds us easily with our taxi note.</div>
  </details>

  <details>
    <summary>Payment & deposit</summary>
    <div class="ans">Platform handles payment. No additional deposit required on arrival.</div>
  </details>
</section>
